{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"labotep","id":"346493235948158977","is_bot":0,"username":"nyarlathotepcc"},"author_id":"346493235948158977","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"A dejected Traxim enters the lodge and begins to look for a yeti. They tend to stand out so he could only assume that not seeing one meant there were none present. Traxim sits down and starts writing on some paper.\n\n```Archivist Daysong,\n I was unable to complete my mission yesterday due to Brother Rah’s murder. I did get a chance to spy on the one Sister Kiln warmed us about but they said nothing incriminating.\n\nTraxim```","created_at":"2020-07-27T14:56:57.693000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-27T14:57:32.855000Z","id":"737322646395420723","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"638590342005784588","content":"Kiln slides a sealed letter into Archivist Daysong's quarters. \n\n||Archivist, I believe that I have set up camp on tha front porch of the Golden Dawn's hideout on the ship. I also have reason ta believe that Brother Ebuc is a traitor, he conspires wit Goan --doin his biddin an such. He even admitted to me that he owes Goan his life. The one they call Web is suspect as well, during my autopsy o Brother Rah, tha voice o Skitter spoke from behind them. \n\nI'm afraid Archivist, fer my well bein. I'll likely be following the same path as Brother Rah. Which brings me ta their method of murder, some how they are able to draw tha very life force from their victims. It seems to be an incredibly powerful magik, and makes sense that Rah had no injuries on his body.\n\nBest of luck ta all my Siblings in tha Mason's. \n\nKiln Singebeard, Afflicted of Osiris. ||","created_at":"2020-07-27T15:07:12.633000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"737325225640984626","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
